#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1332
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Expert Light Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nExpert Light Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Light Magic and can pay the price of 1000 gold."
